### Rust
# Cargo build output
target/

# Local WAL runtime data
/wal/

# Cargo.lock is committed: this is a binary workspace (see
# https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html)

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

